    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/162ceffa3333926a59683c54a485f414.avif?t=1734054777\" /></span></p><br><h1>JOIN US!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Seal: WHAT the FUN&quot; is an omniverse massively multiplayer party royale game that allows up to 10 players to enjoy a range of rounds in less than 10 minutes! <strong>Sign up now!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Jump, and Win! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the finish line and stand on the podium by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete, Cooperate, and Betray! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of everything near you. The are unpredictable obstacles and exciting items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-of-a-kind Rounds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various unique rounds from shooting, racing, climbing, surviving, and matching puzzles. Non-stop excitement, no idle moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with style! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your characters and express yourself with fantastic emoji, visual-effects, and other special features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Seal: WHAT the FUN&quot; is an omniverse massively multiplayer party royale game that allows up to 10 players to enjoy a range of rounds in less than 10 minutes! <strong>Sign up now!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, Jump, and Win! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the finish line and stand on the podium by any means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/2e6de4249ceac7a141d49babf4f09411.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete, Cooperate, and Betray! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of everything near you. The are unpredictable obstacles and exciting items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11c32ddb3395759bb91329996cf142a9.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-of-a-kind Rounds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various unique rounds from shooting, racing, climbing, surviving, and matching puzzles. Non-stop excitement, no idle moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/11dbf28f2bfd4fd26ce62e6ce150a417.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with style! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your characters and express yourself with fantastic emoji, visual-effects, and other special features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.poster.avif?t=1734054777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.webm?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347910/extras/8a966d5e4e8b3c4355ee61c7cd86be6d.mp4?t=1734054777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
